From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tgwear <tgwear@example.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] ApplicationLoader: 启动时拉起 WearBridgeService

在 ApplicationLoader.onCreate() 末尾、ProxyRotationController.init() 之后，
启动 WearBridgeService。这样 App 一启动桥接就上线，无需等待用户操作。

Service 内部会自检 UserConfig 登录状态，未登录时仅维持 interconnect 连接
并在手表端拉取 auth.getState 时返回未授权。

---
 .../main/java/org/telegram/messenger/ApplicationLoader.java  | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/ApplicationLoader.java b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/ApplicationLoader.java
index 0000000..3333333 100644
--- a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/ApplicationLoader.java
+++ b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/ApplicationLoader.java
@@
         AndroidUtilities.runOnUIThread(ApplicationLoader::startPushService);
         LauncherIconController.tryFixLauncherIconIfNeeded();
         ProxyRotationController.init();
+
+        // tgwear: 启动桥接 Service（前台 Service，保持 interconnect 通道在线）
+        try {
+            applicationContext.startForegroundService(
+                new Intent(applicationContext, org.telegram.tgwear.WearBridgeService.class));
+        } catch (Throwable ignore) {
+            FileLog.e("tgwear: start WearBridgeService failed", ignore);
+        }
     }
